    "focal_region": {
      "annotated_sentence_text": "[Turn 5 USER]\ne038\tThe cultural center says the exhibition can be small—perhaps twenty items—and they are comfortable showing captions as provisional or including two versions of a story.\ne039\tThey need a commitment in a month to reserve the spring slot.\ne040\tTomas sees that flexibility as answering my concern.\ne041\tI feel relieved and also suspicious of my relief, because twenty items still create a frame.\ne042\tWhatever we choose becomes “our family” to strangers who will not see the rest.\n[Turn 5 ASSISTANT]\ne043\tAny selection will create a frame, including waiting until the catalog is complete.\ne044\tThe center's flexibility reduces pressure to pretend certainty, but it does not eliminate authorship.\ne045\tYou could define the exhibition more narrowly—as twenty objects about how family memory is assembled—rather than as a representative family history.\ne046\tThat may be honest, though it risks making the process the subject when Tomas wants the lives and migration stories to remain central.\n[Turn 6 USER]\ne047\tYes, he would hate an exhibition mainly about archival uncertainty.\ne048\tHe wants people to meet our relatives as people, not examples in a seminar about memory.\ne049\tI agree with him.\ne050\tI also learned that our mother would like to see something public while she can still participate actively.\ne051\tShe is not pressuring us, but that changes the cost of waiting for me.\ne052\tAt the same time, she tends to smooth conflict and may support captions that other relatives dispute.\n[Turn 6 ASSISTANT]\ne053\tYour mother's wish adds a meaningful time dimension without making speed automatically correct.\ne054\tHer participation could bring warmth and knowledge, while her preference for harmony is one perspective among several.\ne055\tThe exhibition might be designed around a limited period or theme where the evidence and permissions are stronger, leaving contested material in the archive for later work.\ne056\tBut selecting the least contested material could also produce exactly the smooth family story you are trying to avoid.",
